// PKM for operator without overload (author's decision 2026-10-28): in the "Edit" panel - "Add +(i64,
// str)", as an error card; added - operator, as in prelude.
// program: editor_add_operator.vish
open_view module
hover 1 @+
// expect: kind="панель" text="x + \"a\" : тип неизвестен"
// expect: kind="добавить" text="+(i64, str)"
goto 1 +(i64,\sstr)
// expect: name="добавить +(i64, str)"
key 1 Enter
// expect: operator (i64 a) + (str b) {
